<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Arthritis Res Ther</journal-id><journal-title>Arthritis Research &#x00026; Therapy</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">1478-6354</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1478-6362</issn><publisher><publisher-name>BioMed Central</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2374463</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">ar2351</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/ar2351</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction: Cells of the synovium in rheumatoid arthritis. Chondrocytes</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib id="A1" contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Otero</surname><given-names>Miguel</given-names></name><xref ref-type="aff" rid="I1">1</xref></contrib><contrib id="A2" corresp="yes" contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Goldring</surname><given-names>Mary B</given-names></name><xref ref-type="aff" rid="I1">1</xref><email>goldringm@hss.edu</email></contrib></contrib-group><aff id="I1"><label>1</label>Research Division of the Hospital for Special Surgery, Weill College of Medicine of Cornell University, Caspary Research Building, 535 E. 70th Street, New York, NY 10021, USA</aff><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><year>2008</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>16</day><month>1</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>10</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>401</fpage><lpage>401</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://arthritis-research.com/content/10/1/401"/><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2008 BioMed Central Ltd</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2008</copyright-year><copyright-holder>BioMed Central Ltd</copyright-holder></permissions><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="9" page="220" id="N0x1e5be00N0x3796f00" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18001488" ext-link-type="pubmed"/></article-meta><notes><p>See related review article by Otero and Goldring, <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://arthritis-research.com/content/9/5/220"/></p></notes></front><body><p>After publication of our recent article [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B1">1</xref>], we noticed an error in the third sentence of the third paragraph of the section entitled, 'Joint inflammation and cartilage remodeling in RA'.</p><p>This sentence should read:</p><p>ADAMTS-5 is expressed constitutively, whereas ADAMTS-4 is more prominently regulated by inflammatory cytokines.</p></body><back><ref-list><ref id="B1"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Otero</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldring</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cells of the synovium in rheumatoid arthritis. Chondrocytes</article-title><source>Arthritis Res Ther</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>220</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18001488</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/ar2292</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>